    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37762" root="لطخ" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْخٌ</span></b>  [and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْخَةٌ</span></b> ] <i>A small portion</i> or <i>quantity;
a particle;</i> of clouds (S, L, K) and the like,
(K,) and of news, or tidings, or information:
(L:) and [<i>a small quantity</i>] of rain. (K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذيل</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْخٌ</span> [<i>A soil,</i> or <i>pollution,</i> or <i>taint</i>].
(See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْحٌ</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْخَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A soil, a splash.</i>]

